# Day-to-day: user onboarding funnel: linear stages with drop-off branches at each step and percentage labels.
title "Onboarding funnel"
dir RIGHT
visit[Visit site]
signup[Sign up]
verify[Verify email]
profile[Complete profile]
first[First project] :green
active(Active user) :green
d1(Dropped: bounce) :red
d2(Dropped: unverified) :red
d3(Dropped: abandoned) :red
visit -> signup : 40%
signup -> verify : 85%
verify -> profile : 70%
profile -> first : 60%
first -> active : 50%
visit --> d1
signup --> d2
verify --> d3
